{{/*
The source mirror's page.

This page is a license obligation, not a convenience. Several
artifacts carry GPL- and LGPL-licensed components, and those licenses
require the corresponding source to be offered from the same place
that offers the binaries. An offer nobody can browse is an offer a
reader has to take on trust, so the files are listed here by name.

The mirror is keyed by each component's own upstream version, not by a
liken release version, because one component version usually serves
many releases.
*/}}
{{template "head" .}}
<nav><a href="/">← every release</a></nav>

<h1>{{.Mark}} <span>Corresponding source</span></h1>

<p>These are the sources for the GPL- and LGPL-licensed components
that liken redistributes in its releases. Each release's
<code>LICENSES.md</code> names which license applies to what.</p>

<p>A component appears under its own upstream version, because one
version of a component usually ships in many releases. The release
document of any release names the component versions it carries.</p>

{{range .Sources}}
<h2>{{.Name}}</h2>
{{range .Versions}}
<p><code>{{.Version}}</code></p>
<ul>
{{range .Files}}
<li><a href="/sources/{{.Path}}"><code>{{.Name}}</code></a></li>
{{end}}
</ul>
{{end}}
{{end}}

{{template "foot" .}}
